    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Halfling Fenari love an audience. When you succeed on an attack roll, ability check, or saving throw while an ally can see you, you can strut a little: one ally within 30 feet of you who can see you gains a <strong>1d4</strong> bonus to their next D20 Test before the end of their next turn. You can use this trait a number of times equal to your Proficiency Bonus, and you regain all expended uses when you finish a Long Rest.</p>",
